    /// during GC sweep. Mirrors `build_deinit_body`.

    /// Lower a method: slot 0 is `this` (instance methods), followed by the
    /// declared parameters. Mirrors `build_method_body`.

    /// Lower a property accessor. The getter returns the property value; the
    /// setter takes `value` in the slot after `this` (if any), runs the
    /// accessor body, and returns unit. Mirrors `build_property_body`.

